        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>诗句卡片九宫格</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #d9d9d9;\n    font-family: \"Songti SC\", \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    color: #2a2622;\n  }\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    grid-template-rows: repeat(3, 235px);\n    gap: 4px;\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .cell {\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 26px 18px 18px 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .row1 .cell { background: #f7f5f1; }\n  .row2 .cell { background: #f3ece2; }\n  .row3 .cell { background: #f7f5f1; }\n\n  /* vertical title label at left */\n  .title-v {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    margin-right: 14px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  .title-v.big {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n  }\n  .body-v {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n  }\n  .body-h {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .body-v.small { font-size: 11px; line-height: 2.0; }\n  .num {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    bottom: 10px;\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 15px;\n    border: 1px solid #c9c2b6;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    color: #a9a196;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #bdb6aa;\n    color: #8d867c;\n    font-size: 8px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .ph-scribble {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 8px;\n    bottom: 34px;\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 46px;\n  }\n  .ph-strip {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 18px;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 60px;\n    height: 10px;\n    border-top: 1px dashed #bdb6aa;\n    border-left: 1px dashed #bdb6aa;\n    border-right: 1px dashed #bdb6aa;\n    font-size: 7px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"grid\">\n\n  <!-- ===== Row 1 ===== -->\n  <div class=\"row1\" style=\"display:contents\">\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title-v\">口红<br>游戏</div>\n      <div class=\"body-v\">用吻，<br>在你苦苦练就的腹肌上，<br>下一盘棋。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title-v\">讲解<br>词</div>\n      <div class=\"body-v\">三千年后，<br>他们的屋子，<br>成为人类最后一个遗迹。<br><br>讲解员说：<br>这里的每把椅子，<br>都摆过他们两个人。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title-v\">人类<br>观习<br>课</div>\n      <div class=\"body-v\">夜晚来临，<br>一群麻雀，<br>站在窗前，<br>认真记笔记：<br>人类情侣的显性特征是——<br>屋子很大，<br>但他们要贴在一起<br>啾</div>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder ph-scribble\">[手绘线条: 右下]</figure>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ===== Row 2 ===== -->\n  <div class=\"row2\" style=\"display:contents\">\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title-v big\">站<br>稳<br>扶<br>好</div>\n      <div class=\"body-v small\">地铁提示标写：<br>站稳扶好。<br>今晚，<br>我也打算这样提醒你。</div>\n      <div class=\"badge\">durex</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title-v big\">镜<br>子</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-left:10px\">\n        <div class=\"num\">17<br>21<br>57<br>69</div>\n        <div class=\"body-h\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">早上我照镜子时突然有点害羞，<br>觉得它什么都看见了。</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"badge\">durex</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title-v big\">独<br>一<br>份<br>的<br>时<br>尚</div>\n      <div class=\"body-v small\">我这么一个人，<br>哪懂什么时尚，<br>回过神的发型，<br>唱过歌的嗓子，<br>跳过舞的腿，<br>穿过你的衣服。<br><br>我这么一个人，<br>为了时尚的你，<br>涨红脸庞，<br>学了几个时兴的姿势。</div>\n      <div class=\"badge\">durex</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ===== Row 3 ===== -->\n  <div class=\"row3\" style=\"display:contents\">\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title-v\">我们<br>身体的<br>实时<br>天气</div>\n      <div class=\"body-v small\">雨，<br>一会儿落，<br>一会儿停。<br><br>令，<br>一会儿掉，<br>一会儿合。<br><br>我，<br>一会儿想你，<br>一会儿又想你。</div>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder ph-strip\">[图形: 左下]</figure>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title-v\">毕生<br>宏愿</div>\n      <div class=\"body-v\">代替那名医生，<br>为你做一场全面体检。<br>还要在你的基因里，<br>植入一场爱我的突变。</div>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder ph-strip\">[图形: 左下]</figure>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title-v\">象限<br>游戏</div>\n      <div class=\"body-v\">我180°地躺，<br>你90°地坐，<br>搭一架，<br>只有一二象限的坐标系。</div>\n      <figure class=\"placeholder ph-strip\">[图形: 左下]</figure>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
